[(By default, the block size is 64 samples at a 48 Khz)]
[(sample rate \050about 1.33 ms.\051 You can change the sample)]
[(rate in audio settings and the block size with the)]
[([block~] or [switch~] object, but the minimum block)]
[(size [bang~] can handle is 64 and it can't output)]
[(bangs at a faster rate than the largest block size of)]
[(its parent patches \050so you cannot reduce the block)]
[(size in a subwindow and expect it to work\051.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
